===persian===

زیر پایم گُل...
آسمانم بارانِ باریده... ابر...
و... دلم گلدانی...
ساقه‌هایِ عشق... برگ‌هایِ باد...
عطری از خاطرهٔ خندهٔ تو...
در شبی هذیانی... خواب می‌بینم...
چوب سیگاری...
با نفس‌های تو پربرگ شده است...
باز هم این گلدان را...
در هوای تو رها خواهم کرد...
هرچه بادا... باد...
ساق پیرم... اما...
با نفس‌هایِ تو... گُل خواهم داد...
محمودآباد ۱۳۷۲/۵/۲۱

===machine===

Under my feet, a flower...
my sky, rain already fallen... cloud...
and... my heart a flowerpot...
The stalks of love... the leaves of the wind...
a scent out of the memory of your laughter...
On a delirious night... I dream...
a cigarette holder...
has come into leaf with your breath...
Once again I will let this pot...
go loose in the air of you...
Come what... may...
My stalk is old... and yet...
with your breath... I will flower...
Mahmudabad 1372/5/21

===lantern===

A flower under my feet,
my sky the rain already fallen — cloud —
and my heart a flowerpot:
stalks of love, leaves of wind,
a scent out of the memory of your laughing.
On a delirious night I dream
that a cigarette holder
has come into leaf with your breath.
Once more I will let this pot go
loose in the air of you.
Come what may.
My stalk is old — and even so,
with your breath on it, I will flower...

Mahmudabad 1372/5/21

